OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers easing off with some
OL,7,Flate evening sunshine possible. Mostly
OL,8,Fdry overnight with a few clear spells.
OL,9,FMild for most, but perhaps cooler in
OL,10,Fprone rural spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FDry to start, perhaps with
OL,13,Fsome early sunny spells mainly for
OL,14,Feastern coasts. Cloud thickening, with
OL,15,Frain arriving in the afternoon, this
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
